## Commands

- Install: `<command>`
- Test (all): `<command>`
- Test (single file): `<command>`
- Lint: `<command>`
- Type-check: `<command>`
- Build: `<command>`
- E2E tests: `<command>` (see the `e2e-tests` skill for conventions)

## Git and PR conventions

- Base branch: `main`
- Branch naming: `<type>/<ISSUE-KEY>-<short-description>` (e.g. `feat/PROJ-125-invoice-export`)
- Commit messages: <e.g., Conventional Commits>
- Keeping branches updated: <rebase | merge>
- PR title: `<ISSUE-KEY>: <short description>`
- PR template: <path, if any>

## Jira workflow

- Project key: `<PROJ>`
- Status when work starts: `<In Progress>`
- Status when the PR is open: `<In Review>`
- Status when merged: `<Done>`

## Work workflow

- Works with any Jira issue: epic, story, task, or bug.
- Working files live in `.claude/work/<ISSUE-KEY>/` (analysis, plan, plan review, reviews).
- Flow: `/work-analyze` → `/work-plan` → `/work-critique-plan` (for large or risky plans) → `/work-plan` (revise) → for each task: `/task-implement` → `/review` → `/task-fix` → `/task-deliver`.
